@startuml KTOB_07_sequence_add_book
title KTOB — Search, Manual Fallback and Add to Library
actor Reader
participant "Angular UI" as UI
participant "Java API" as API
participant "Identity guard" as Guard
participant "Catalog module" as Catalog
participant "Open Library" as Open
participant "Library module" as Library
database "Supabase Postgres" as DB
Reader -> UI : Search by title/author
UI -> API : Search request
API -> Catalog : search(query)
Catalog -> Open : GET work metadata
alt External API returns matching works
 Open --> Catalog : candidate works
 Catalog --> API : works and known metadata
 API --> UI : results
 Reader -> UI : Choose work
else Empty, error, or wrong results
 Open --> Catalog : none / unavailable
 Catalog --> API : manual entry permitted
 API --> UI : manual entry option
 Reader -> UI : Enter title and optional details
end
Reader -> UI : Add to personal library
UI -> API : Add selected/manual work
API -> Guard : authenticate + authorize reader
Guard --> API : verified readerId
API -> Library : addWork(readerId, work)
Library -> DB : check existing work entry
alt Work already in reader's library
 DB --> Library : existing entry
 Library --> API : existing entry; offer to view
else New work entry
 Library -> DB : create work if necessary, then entry
 DB --> Library : stored entry
 Library --> API : created
end
API --> UI : entry / existing response
UI --> Reader : personal library result
note over UI,API
Never auto-mark as owned or currently reading.
Edition selection remains optional.
end note
@enduml
